<a href="/public/news/21412.pdf">
CANADA GROWTH FUND GIBSON ENERGY AND VARME ENERGY ANNOUNCE STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP TO ADVANCE CANADIAN WASTE-TO-ENERGY PROJECT_Final_EN.pdf</a>
